# CLAUDE.md

## Read AGENTS.md first

**[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) is the source of truth for how work is done in this repository** — the definition of done, the non-negotiable rules, the required spec and changelog updates, and the commands. It applies to every agent and every human equally.

This file holds only the *architectural context* that is expensive to rediscover by reading code. **Where the two overlap, AGENTS.md wins**, and this file should be corrected rather than argued with.

Before changing anything:
1. Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for the current rules and commands.
2. Read [STATUS.md](STATUS.md) if picking up work that might already be in progress.
3. Read this file for the "why" behind anything that looks non-obvious.

### The short version of the contract
Run the verification command, add a test, add a CHANGELOG entry. Bump the spec for anything user-visible or architectural. Never edit a shipped migration.

